{"id":"55704ff8-2924-4a52-be89-aa4717bf7044","rule_id":"4330272b-9724-4bc6-a3ca-f1532b81e5c2","name":"【默认】双端异常登录活动（机器学习）","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":208,"revision":9,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:17.788Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:56:13.633Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"15m","from":"now-45m","to":"now","description":"机器学习：异常登录活动（含异常时间）。适用于跨平台认证日志。对应需求：异常账号登录时间。","tags":["操作系统: 双端","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1110","name":"Brute Force","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":">=1.18.0"},{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"},{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n机器学习判定登录活动异常。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是账号盗用或异常时间访问。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对登录时间是否符合岗位。\n2. 核对源地址与设备。\n3. 异常则重置凭证并审查会话。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["值班、变更窗口导致的非常规登录"],"references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"machine_learning","anomaly_threshold":50,"machine_learning_job_id":["suspicious_login_activity_ea"]}
